### ==========================================================
### CONTACTS — las personas con las que se comparten gastos.
### Un contacto NO es una cuenta: no tiene saldo, no sale en
### /accounts, y su email es a quién se dirige una invitación a
### un grupo (de aquí no se envía nada: ver invitations.http).
### ==========================================================
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@email = tester@test.com
@password = SecureP@ss123

# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

###

@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Listar (éxito) — pagina de verdad desde el primer día
GET {{baseUrl}}/contacts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar incluyendo archivados
GET {{baseUrl}}/contacts?includeArchived=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear contacto (éxito) — el email se normaliza a minúsculas
# @name createContact
POST {{baseUrl}}/contacts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ana {{$randomInt 100 999}}", "color": "TEAL", "email": "Ana@Example.com" }

###

@contactId = {{createContact.response.body.id}}
@contactVersion = {{createContact.response.body.updatedAt}}

### Get por id (éxito)
GET {{baseUrl}}/contacts/{{contactId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear con nombre repetido — 409 DUPLICATE (el nombre del de arriba, tal cual: la colación pliega mayúsculas)
POST {{baseUrl}}/contacts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "{{createContact.response.body.name}}" }

### Un campo que el contacto no tiene se descarta (201, y no llega)
POST {{baseUrl}}/contacts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Beto {{$randomInt 100 999}}", "linkedUserId": "019576a0-d7b6-7d6d-af6a-2b7545f5acff" }

### Email inválido — 400 VALIDATION
POST {{baseUrl}}/contacts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Carla {{$randomInt 100 999}}", "email": "carla@" }

### Update (éxito) — parcial
PUT {{baseUrl}}/contacts/{{contactId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ana María {{$randomInt 100 999}}", "color": "PURPLE" }

### Borrar el email — null lo quita del documento
PUT {{baseUrl}}/contacts/{{contactId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": null }

### Update con If-Match viejo — 409 STALE_UPDATE, con la copia del servidor en `current`
PUT {{baseUrl}}/contacts/{{contactId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
If-Match: {{contactVersion}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ana la de ayer" }

### Update sin ningún campo — 400 VALIDATION
PUT {{baseUrl}}/contacts/{{contactId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Archivar (soft delete) — responde el contacto archivado, no un mensaje
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/contacts/{{contactId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Archivar de nuevo — IDEMPOTENTE (200)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/contacts/{{contactId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get del archivado — SÍ responde (archivedAt lo distingue)
GET {{baseUrl}}/contacts/{{contactId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update de un archivado — 400 RESOURCE_ARCHIVED
PUT {{baseUrl}}/contacts/{{contactId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ana otra vez" }

### Restaurar (éxito) — opcionalmente con nombre nuevo, en la misma escritura
POST {{baseUrl}}/contacts/{{contactId}}/restore
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Restaurar de nuevo — IDEMPOTENTE (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/contacts/{{contactId}}/restore
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Id ajeno o inexistente — 404 uniforme
GET {{baseUrl}}/contacts/019576a0-d7b6-7d6d-af6a-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cursor inventado — 400 INVALID_CURSOR, nunca la primera página en silencio
GET {{baseUrl}}/contacts?cursor=019576a0-d7b6-7d6d-af6a-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
